{{ heroBlock("Large Value Handling", "Multi-line and long values are formatted clearly with line-by-line diffs in collapsible sections.", "hero hero-secondary") }}

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-container">
    {% call featureDetail("", "all providers", "Configuration files, JSON policies, and user data scripts can be huge. tfplan2md automatically detects large values and moves them to a dedicated section with collapsible details, keeping the main report clean.") %}
      {% call comparisonBlock() %}
        <div class="comparison-column">
          <h3 class="comparison-title">❌ Without tfplan2md</h3>
          <div class="code-block">
            <div class="code-header">
              <span class="code-title">Raw Terraform Output</span>
            </div>
            <div class="example-content">
              <pre style="white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-x: hidden;"><code># azurerm_api_management_policy.global will be updated in-place
~ resource "azurerm_api_management_policy" "global" {
    ~ xml_content = "&lt;policies&gt;\n  &lt;inbound&gt;\n    &lt;rate-limit calls=\"100\" renewal-period=\"60\" /&gt;\n    &lt;ip-filter action=\"allow\"&gt;...\n    &lt;validate-jwt ...&gt;...\n    &lt;set-backend-service base-url=\"https://backend-old.example.com\" /&gt;\n  &lt;/inbound&gt;\n&lt;/policies&gt;"
      -&gt; "&lt;policies&gt;\n  &lt;inbound&gt;\n    &lt;rate-limit calls=\"200\" renewal-period=\"60\" /&gt;\n    &lt;ip-filter action=\"allow\"&gt;...\n    &lt;validate-jwt ...&gt;...\n    &lt;set-backend-service base-url=\"https://backend-new.example.com\" /&gt;\n    &lt;quota-by-key ... /&gt;\n  &lt;/inbound&gt;\n&lt;/policies&gt;"
  }</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="comparison-note">Large XML or JSON blobs embedded in escaped strings are nearly impossible to review safely.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="comparison-column">
          <h3 class="comparison-title">✅ With tfplan2md</h3>
          {% exampleBlock "features--large-values--example-1" %}
          <p class="comparison-note">Readable formatted content with inline diff highlighting makes every change reviewable.</p>
        </div>
      {% endcall %}

      <div class="feature-highlights">
        <h3 class="highlights-title">Smart Formatting</h3>
        <ul class="highlights-list">
          <li><strong>Automatic detection:</strong> long or multi-line values are moved out of the primary attribute tables</li>
          <li><strong>Collapsible sections:</strong> reviewers can expand details only when they need them</li>
          <li><strong>Line-by-line diffs:</strong> edits within large text blocks remain visible instead of collapsing into noise</li>
          <li><strong>Readable rendering:</strong> formatted JSON, YAML, XML, and scripts stay legible in PR comments</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-example">
        <h3 class="example-title">Configuration</h3>
        <p class="feature-detail-description">Control the diff format for large values using the <code>--render-target</code> CLI option:</p>
        {{ codeWindow("Command", '<pre><code># Default: azuredevops (HTML with character-level highlighting)\ntfplan2md plan.json\n\n# GitHub-compatible diff format (markdown code blocks)\ntfplan2md plan.json --render-target github</code></pre>') }}
        <p class="feature-detail-description" style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          <em>The <code>--large-value-format</code> flag has been deprecated. Use <code>--render-target azuredevops</code> instead of <code>inline-diff</code>, or <code>--render-target github</code> instead of <code>standard-diff</code>.</em>
        </p>
      </div>
    {% endcall %}
  </div>
</section>


